(8) Tj T*
(People and Process) Tj T*
(After all that talk of CI/CD, observability, and dynamic pipelines, why the focus on people and) Tj T*
(process? Because the best technology in the world is ineffective without the right team to) Tj T*
(build, manage, and govern it.) Tj T*
(That customer service agent isn't magically prevented from giving away free products; an) Tj T*
(AI Engineer and a Prompt Engineer design and implement the guardrails. The confidential) Tj T*
(database isn't secured by an abstract concept; a Cloud Platform team configures the) Tj T*
(authentication. Behind every successful, production-grade agent there is a well-orchestrated) Tj T*
(team of specialists, and in this section, we'll introduce the key players.) Tj T*
(Practical Implementation Guide) Tj T*
(Throughout this whitepaper, practical examples reference the Google Cloud Platform) Tj T*
(Agent Starter Pack1--1a Python package providing production-ready Generative AI) Tj T*
(agent templates for Google Cloud. It includes pre-built agents, automated CI/CD) Tj T*
(setup, Terraform deployment, Agent platform evaluation integration and built-in) Tj T*
(Google Cloud observability. The starter pack demonstrates the concepts discussed) Tj T*
(here with working code you can deploy in minutes.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
