(11) Tj T*
(Figure 2: How multiple teams collaborate to operationalize both models and GenAI applications) Tj T*
(The Journey to Production) Tj T*
(Now that we've established the team, we turn to the process. How do we translate the work) Tj T*
(of all these specialists into a system that is trustworthy, reliable, and ready for users?) Tj T*
(The answer lies in a disciplined pre-production process built on a single core principle:) Tj T*
(Evaluation-Gated Deployment. The idea is simple but powerful: no agent version should) Tj T*
(reach users without first passing a comprehensive evaluation that proves its quality and) Tj T*
(safety. This pre-production phase is where we trade manual uncertainty for automated) Tj T*
(confidence, and it consists of three pillars: a rigorous evaluation process that acts as a) Tj T*
(quality gate, an automated CI/CD pipeline that enforces it, and safe rollout strategies to) Tj T*
(de-risk the final step into production.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
