(Page 13 of 41 - Prototype to  Production) Tj T*
(Prototype to Production) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(13) Tj T*
(Regardless of the method, the principle is the same: no agent proceeds to production) Tj T*
(without a quality check. We covered the specifics of what to measure and how to build this) Tj T*
(evaluation harness in our deep dive on Day 4: Agent Quality: Observability, Logging,) Tj T*
(Tracing, Evaluation, Metrics, which explored everything from crafting a 'golden dataset' \(a) Tj T*
(curated, representative set of test cases designed to assess an agent's intended behavior) Tj T*
(and guardrail compliance\) to implementing LLM-as-a-judge techniques, to finally using a) Tj T*
(service like Agent Platform's Agent Evaluation2 to power evaluation.) Tj T*
(The Automated CI/CD Pipeline) Tj T*
(An AI agent is a composite system, comprising not just source code but also prompts, tool) Tj T*
(definitions, and configuration files. This complexity introduces significant challenges: how do) Tj T*
(we ensure a change to a prompt doesn't degrade the performance of a tool? How do we test) Tj T*
(the interplay between all these artifacts before they reach users?) Tj T*
(The solution is a CI/CD \(Continuous Integration/Continuous Deployment\) pipeline. It is more) Tj T*
(than just an automation script; it's a structured process that helps different people in a team) Tj T*
(collaborate to manage complexity and ensure quality. It works by testing changes in stages,) Tj T*
(incrementally building confidence before the agent is released to users.) Tj T*
(A robust pipeline is designed as a funnel. It catches errors as early and as cheaply as) Tj T*
(possible, a practice often called "shifting left." It separates fast, pre-merge checks from more) Tj T*
(comprehensive, resource-intensive post-merge deployments. This progressive workflow is) Tj T*
(typically structured into three distinct phases:) Tj T*
(1. Phase 1: Pre-Merge Integration \(CI\). The pipeline's first responsibility is to provide) Tj T*
(rapid feedback to the AI Engineer or Prompt Engineer who has opened a pull request.) Tj T*
(Triggered automatically, this CI phase acts as a gatekeeper for the main branch. It runs) Tj T*
(fast checks like unit tests, code linting, and dependency scanning. Crucially, this is the) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
