(Page 14 of 41 - Prototype to  Production) Tj T*
(Prototype to Production) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(14) Tj T*
(ideal stage to run the agent quality evaluation suite designed by Prompt Engineers.) Tj T*
(This provides immediate feedback on whether a change improves or degrades the agent's) Tj T*
(performance against key scenarios before it is ever merged. By catching issues here, we) Tj T*
(prevent polluting the main branch. The PR checks configuration template3 generated) Tj T*
(with the Agent Starter Pack1 \(ASP\) is a practical example of implementing this phase with) Tj T*
(Cloud Build.4) Tj T*
(2. Phase 2: Post-Merge Validation in Staging \(CD\). Once a change passes all CI checks--) Tj T*
(including the performance evaluation--and is merged, the focus shifts from code and) Tj T*
(performance correctness to the operational readiness of the integrated system. The) Tj T*
(Continuous Deployment \(CD\) process, often managed by the MLOps Team, packages) Tj T*
(the agent and deploys it to a staging environment--a high-fidelity replica of production.) Tj T*
(Here, more comprehensive, resource-intensive tests are run, such as load testing and) Tj T*
(integration tests against remote services. This is also the critical phase for internal user) Tj T*
(testing \(often called "dogfooding"\), where humans within the company can interact with) Tj T*
(the agent and provide qualitative feedback before it reaches the end user. This ensures) Tj T*
(that the agent as an integrated system performs reliably and efficiently under production-) Tj T*
(like conditions before it is considered for release. The staging deployment template5 from) Tj T*
(ASP shows an example of this deployment.) Tj T*
(3. Phase 3: Gated Deployment to Production. After the agent has been thoroughly) Tj T*
(validated in the staging environment, the final step is deploying to production. This) Tj T*
(is almost never fully automatic, typically requiring a Product Owner to give the final) Tj T*
(sign-off, ensuring human-in-the-loop. Upon approval, the exact deployment artifact) Tj T*
(that was tested and validated in staging is promoted to the production environment.) Tj T*
(This production deployment template6 generated with ASP shows how this final phase) Tj T*
(retrieves the validated artifact and deploys it to production with appropriate safeguards.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
