(Page 20 of 41 - Prototype to  Production) Tj T*
(Prototype to Production) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(20) Tj T*
(For example, in Google Cloud, this is achieved through the operations suite: a user's request) Tj T*
(generates a unique ID in Cloud Trace15 that links the Agent Runtime9 invocation, model) Tj T*
(calls, and tool executions with visible durations. Detailed logs flow to Cloud Logging16,) Tj T*
(while Cloud Monitoring17 dashboards alert when latency thresholds are exceeded. The) Tj T*
(Agent Development Kit \(ADK\)18 provides built-in Cloud Trace integration for automatic) Tj T*
(instrumentation of agent operations.) Tj T*
(By implementing these pillars, we move from operating in the dark to having a clear, data-) Tj T*
(driven view of our agent's behavior, providing the foundation needed to manage it effectively) Tj T*
(in production. \(For a full discussion of these concepts, see Agent Quality: Observability,) Tj T*
(Logging, Tracing, Evaluation, Metrics\).) Tj T*
(Act: The Levers of Operational Control) Tj T*
(Observations without action are just expensive dashboards. The "Act" phase is about real-) Tj T*
(time intervention--the levers you pull to manage the agent's performance, cost, and safety) Tj T*
(based on what you observe.) Tj T*
(Think of "Act" as the system's automated reflexes designed to maintain stability in real-time.) Tj T*
(In contrast, "Evolve", which will be covered later, is the strategic process of learning from) Tj T*
(behavior to create a fundamentally better system.) Tj T*
(Because an agent is autonomous, you cannot pre-program every possible outcome. Instead,) Tj T*
(you must build robust mechanisms to influence its behavior in production. These operational) Tj T*
(levers fall into two primary categories: managing the system's health and managing its risk.) Tj T*
(Managing System Health: Performance, Cost, and Scale) Tj T*
(Unlike traditional microservices, an agent's workload is dynamic and stateful. Managing its) Tj T*
(health requires a strategy for handling this unpredictability.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
