(Page 24 of 41 - Prototype to  Production) Tj T*
(Prototype to Production) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(24) Tj T*
(The Evolution Workflow: From Insight to Deployed Improvement) Tj T*
(1. Analyze Production Data: Identify trends in user behavior, task success rates, and) Tj T*
(security incidents from production logs.) Tj T*
(2. Update Evaluation Datasets: Transform production failures into tomorrow's test cases,) Tj T*
(augmenting your golden dataset.) Tj T*
(3. Refine and Deploy: Commit improvements to trigger the automated pipeline--whether) Tj T*
(refining prompts, adding tools, or updating guardrails.) Tj T*
(This creates a virtuous cycle where your agent continuously improves with every) Tj T*
(user interaction.) Tj T*
(An Evolve Loop in Action) Tj T*
(A retail agent's logs \(Observe\) show that 15% of users receive an error when asking) Tj T*
(for 'similar products.' The product team Acts by creating a high-priority ticket. The) Tj T*
(Evolve phase begins: production logs are used to create a new, failing test case for) Tj T*
(the evaluation dataset. An AI Engineer refines the agent's prompt and adds a new,) Tj T*
(more robust tool for similarity search. The change is committed, passes the now-) Tj T*
(updated evaluation suite in the CI/CD pipeline, and is safely rolled out via a canary) Tj T*
(deployment, resolving the user issue in under 48 hours.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
