(Page 26 of 41 - Prototype to  Production) Tj T*
(Prototype to Production) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(26) Tj T*
(This creates a powerful feedback loop where every production incident makes your agent) Tj T*
(stronger and more resilient, transforming your security posture from a defensive stance to) Tj T*
(one of continuous, proactive improvement.) Tj T*
(To learn more about Responsible AI and securing AI Agentic Systems, please consult) Tj T*
(the whitepaper Google's Approach for Secure AI Agents12 and the Google Secure AI) Tj T*
(Framework \(SAIF\)13.) Tj T*
(Beyond Single-Agent Operations) Tj T*
(You've mastered operating individual agents in production and can ship them at high velocity.) Tj T*
(But as organizations scale to dozens of specialized agents--each built by different teams) Tj T*
(with different frameworks--a new challenge emerges: these agents can't collaborate. The) Tj T*
(next section explores how standardized protocols can transform these isolated agents into) Tj T*
(an interoperable ecosystem, unlocking exponential value through agent collaboration.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
57 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Contents 58 0 R /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R >> >> >>
