/F1 10 Tf
36 756 Td
13 TL
(Page 29 of 41 - Prototype to  Production) Tj T*
(Prototype to Production) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(29) Tj T*
(Snippet 1: A sample agent card for the check_prime_agent) Tj T*
(Adopting this protocol doesn't require an architectural overhaul. Frameworks like the ADK) Tj T*
(simplify this process significantly \(docs25\). You can make an existing agent A2A-compatible) Tj T*
(with a single function call, which automatically generates its AgentCard and makes it) Tj T*
(available on the network.) Tj T*
(Python) Tj T*
({) Tj T*
("name": "check_prime_agent",) Tj T*
("version": "1.0.0",) Tj T*
("description": "An agent specialized in checking whether numbers are prime",) Tj T*
("capabilities": {},) Tj T*
("securitySchemes": {) Tj T*
("agent_oauth_2_0": {) Tj T*
("type": "oauth2",) Tj T*
(}) Tj T*
("defaultInputModes": ["text/plain"],) Tj T*
("defaultOutputModes": ["application/json"],) Tj T*
("skills": [) Tj T*
({) Tj T*
("id": "prime_checking",) Tj T*
("name": "Prime Number Checking",) Tj T*
("description": "Check if numbers are prime using efficient algorithms",) Tj T*
("tags": ["mathematical", "computation", "prime"]) Tj T*
(}) Tj T*
(],) Tj T*
("url": "http://localhost:8001/a2a/check_prime_agent") Tj T*
(}) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
