(Page 31 of 41 - Prototype to  Production) Tj T*
(Prototype to Production) Tj T*
(Updated May 2026) Tj T*
(31) Tj T*
(Snippet 3: Using the ADK's RemoteA2aAgent class to connect to and consume a remote agent) Tj T*
(This unlocks powerful, hierarchical compositions. A root agent can be configured to) Tj T*
(orchestrate both a local sub-agent for a simple task and a remote, specialized agent via A2A,) Tj T*
(creating a more capable system.) Tj T*
(Python) Tj T*
(# Example using ADK: Consuming a remote agent via A2A) Tj T*
(from google.adk.agents.remote_a2a_agent import RemoteA2aAgent) Tj T*
(prime_agent = RemoteA2aAgent\() Tj T*
(name="prime_agent",) Tj T*
(description="Agent that handles checking if numbers are prime.",) Tj T*
(agent_card="http://localhost:8001/a2a/check_prime_agent/) Tj T*
(.well-known/agent-card.json") Tj T*
(\)) Tj T*
ET
endstream
